e of 6.3M. It didn't hold. By Feb 23, 2011 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $78.75.","lesson":"This is an example of a false breakout. Volume on the breakout day was light, and that tell was visible before the move fell apart. Cutting it early was a good read."}}